  "result": "All 617 tests pass and type-checking is clean. The fixes address all four reported issues:\n\n1. **Stale labels** — `issue-service.ts` now validates every `labelIds` entry against the workspace's own labels (`assertLabelsInOrg`) on both create and update.\n2. **Cross-project/cross-workspace/archived sub-issue parents** — `assertValidParent` in `issue-service.ts` requires the parent to be a live issue in the same project (cross-org parents already return `null` via the org-scoped lookup).\n3. **Vanished replies** — `comment-service.ts` now requires `parentId` to reference a live, top-level comment on the same issue.\n4. **Non-member assignee/lead/mentions** — added `assertActiveMember` checks in `issue-service.ts` (assignee, both on create and assign) and `project-service.ts` (lead, on create and update), and `resolveMentionedUsers` now filters both `@handle` resolution and client-supplied mention ids down to current active members only.",
